/*
 * Engineering **experimental-effect mechanics** — the stat modifiers each special
 * effect applies, keyed by its Frontier `fdname`.
 *
 * Sources: EDSY eddb.js `expeffect`, cross-checked against EDCD/coriolis-data; display
 * names observed in-game.
 *
 * Credit and licence terms: ATTRIBUTIONS.md. Acquisition, revisions, derivation and
 * corrections: data/ships/SOURCES.md.
 *
 * Each effect is { name, modifiers, damageDistribution?, description? }.
 * `damageDistribution` is the fixed fractional split produced by a damage-converting
 * effect. A modifier is { label, method, value }: `label` is the journal Modifier Label,
 * `method` controls how it applies, and `value` is the fixed contribution. A purely
 * qualitative effect carries an empty `modifiers` list and a human-readable
 * `description` instead.
 *
 * One-application material requirements live in `experimental-effect-costs.jsonc` so
 * calculating or editing a build does not bundle shopping data.
 */
